WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:25.807
Eddy saw long black marks.

2
00:00:25.808 --> 00:00:36.985
He smelled burnt rubber.

3
00:00:36.986 --> 00:00:40.382
"Watch this!" Poppy yelled.

4
00:00:40.383 --> 00:00:42.299
Vroom!

5
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:45.561
Poppy drove fast.

6
00:00:45.562 --> 00:00:49.177
She slammed on her brakes.

7
00:00:49.178 --> 00:00:51.892
Her wheels stopped.

8
00:00:51.893 --> 00:00:55.038
But Poppy kept going.

9
00:00:55.039 --> 00:00:59.088
She skidded across the parking lot.

10
00:00:59.089 --> 00:01:06.469
Smoke rose from her tires.

11
00:01:06.470 --> 00:01:20.925
Her tires made more black marks.

12
00:01:20.926 --> 00:01:24.939
"That was cool!" said Dipper.

13
00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:27.685
"Now it's my turn!"

14
00:01:27.686 --> 00:01:30.568
Vroom!

15
00:01:30.569 --> 00:01:33.682
Dipper raced across the parking lot.

16
00:01:33.683 --> 00:01:37.091
She slammed on her brakes.

17
00:01:37.092 --> 00:01:44.002
Dipper skidded.

18
00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:47.595
"Good one!" said Poppy.

19
00:01:47.596 --> 00:01:50.837
"Watch me!" Jeb yelled.

20
00:01:50.838 --> 00:01:55.469
He was at the construction site.

21
00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:58.643
He rolled down a dirt hill.

22
00:01:58.644 --> 00:02:05.465
Then he skidded too.

23
00:02:05.466 --> 00:02:09.023
"It's your turn, Eddy!" said Poppy.

24
00:02:09.024 --> 00:02:15.810
"You shouldn't skid," said Eddy.

25
00:02:15.811 --> 00:02:21.023
"It's bad for your tires!"
